{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"Alibaba.OpenCodeReview","latestVersion":"1.13.8","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"Copyright 2026 Alibaba","description":"The open source AI code review agent.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"Copyright 2026 Alibaba","description":"The open source AI code review agent.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Open Code Review is an AI-powered code review CLI tool. It originated as Alibaba Group's internal official AI code review assistant — over the past two years, it has served tens of thousands of developers and identified millions of code defects. After thorough validation at massive scale, we incubated it into an open source project for the community. Simply configure a model endpoint to get started.\nIt reads Git diffs, sends changed files to a configurable LLM via an agent with tool-use capabilities, and generates structured review comments with line-level precision. The agent can read full file contents, search the codebase, inspect other changed files for context, and produce deep reviews — not just surface-level diff feedback.","name":"Open Code Review","packageUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review","publisher":"Alibaba","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba","releaseNotes":"🚀 Features\n- feat(tools): support reading both comparison sides (#1903)\n- feat: add GitHub Copilot CLI integration (plugin manifest + guide) (#1890)\n- feat(llm): prefer MiniMax M3.1 Flash in model suggestions (#1784)\n🐛 Bug Fixes\n- fix(acp): register stub signals before readiness (#1905)\n- fix(ci): upgrade Go toolchains to 1.26.11 (#1904)\n- fix(viewer): preserve literal dollar signs in fenced code blocks (#1889)\n🔧 Refactoring\n- refactor(tools): define tool bindings in task templates (#1898)\n- refactor(cli)!: remove --tools overrides (#1894)\n📖 Documentation\n- docs(plugins): explain Codex delegate review in plugin README (#1753)\n- docs(review-rules): list every built-in rule mapping in all five locales (#1785)\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/compare/v1.13.7...v1.13.8","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/releases/tag/v1.13.8","tags":["ai","code","review"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"开源的 AI 代码审查智能体。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Open Code Review 是一款 AI 驱动的代码审查 CLI 工具。它的前身是阿里集团内部官方 AI 代码审查助手，过去两年在内部服务了数万开发者，识别了数百万个代码缺陷。经过大规模充分验证后，我们将其孵化为开源项目，对社区开放。只需配置一个模型端点即可使用。\n它读取 Git diff，通过具备工具调用能力的 Agent 将变更文件发送至可配置的 LLM，生成具有行级精度的结构化审查意见。Agent 可以读取完整文件内容、搜索代码库、检查其他变更文件以获取上下文，从而进行深度审查——而非仅停留在表面的 diff 反馈。","tags":["人工智能","代码","审查"]}},"longDescription":"Open Code Review is an AI-powered code review CLI tool. It originated as Alibaba Group's internal official AI code review assistant — over the past two years, it has served tens of thousands of developers and identified millions of code defects. After thorough validation at massive scale, we incubated it into an open source project for the community. Simply configure a model endpoint to get started.\nIt reads Git diffs, sends changed files to a configurable LLM via an agent with tool-use capabilities, and generates structured review comments with line-level precision. The agent can read full file contents, search the codebase, inspect other changed files for context, and produce deep reviews — not just surface-level diff feedback.","name":"Open Code Review","packageUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review","publisher":"Alibaba","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba","releaseNotes":"🚀 Features\n- feat(tools): support reading both comparison sides (#1903)\n- feat: add GitHub Copilot CLI integration (plugin manifest + guide) (#1890)\n- feat(llm): prefer MiniMax M3.1 Flash in model suggestions (#1784)\n🐛 Bug Fixes\n- fix(acp): register stub signals before readiness (#1905)\n- fix(ci): upgrade Go toolchains to 1.26.11 (#1904)\n- fix(viewer): preserve literal dollar signs in fenced code blocks (#1889)\n🔧 Refactoring\n- refactor(tools): define tool bindings in task templates (#1898)\n- refactor(cli)!: remove --tools overrides (#1894)\n📖 Documentation\n- docs(plugins): explain Codex delegate review in plugin README (#1753)\n- docs(review-rules): list every built-in rule mapping in all five locales (#1785)\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/compare/v1.13.7...v1.13.8","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/releases/tag/v1.13.8","tags":["ai","code","review"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.8/app.json","detailSha256":"ab17dbf494ec5ea88df930f3b452726d1761a08e674e6aeac60401a31b93167b","releaseDate":"2026-11-12","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"1.13.8"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.7/app.json","detailSha256":"34b97440baa3dddc982793279a27ed5c3e1a18d042b0c335ded70f1db654b34c","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"1.13.7"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.6/app.json","detailSha256":"3e34d03a6af6a0f3d640b6c01f1364e557405e5b35273539d940c7a286540790","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"1.13.6"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.5/app.json","detailSha256":"8f4ace6986b6a44fa26468b6694ce934f6210d91d972ea8943cbe275b5fd7f82","releaseDate":"2026-11-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.13.5"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.13.4/app.json","detailSha256":"9d44b1a60be4b04425f24918408e55527924d2689ad68002c77b6fffcafdd45e","releaseDate":"2026-11-02","releaseDateSour